Error [E1004]: `crypto.sha256_bytes` was retired
  --> tests/ui/crypto_digest_aliases_retired.jet:4:12
    |
  4 |     crypto.sha256_bytes([1])
    |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `crypto.sha256` returns `Digest256`, so the representation is explicit
 Fix: Use `crypto.sha256(bytes).hex()` for text or `.bytes()` for raw bytes
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1004

